{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25936","headline":"留辞杜员外式方 · 鲍溶","name":"留辞杜员外式方","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东风吹旅怀，乡梦无夜无。\n惭见君子堂，贫思上归途。\n海岳泛念深，涓尘复何须。\n婆娑不在本，屈曲无弦弧。\n恻恻奉离尊，承欢独向隅。\n时当凤来日，孰用鸡鸣夫。\n回首九仙门，皇家在玉壶。\n慙非海人别，泪下不成珠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鲍溶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25936.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25936","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}